### Smoke Test: Login Flow End-to-End
### Requisito: Backend corriendo en http://localhost:8000

### POST /api/v1/auth/login — login exitoso
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@vidapersonal.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### POST /api/v1/auth/login — credenciales inválidas
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wrong@email.com",
  "password": "wrongpass"
}

### GET /api/v1/auth/me — obtener usuario autenticado (requiere cookie de sesión del login exitoso)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/me
Accept: application/json

### POST /api/v1/auth/logout — cerrar sesión
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/auth/logout
